commit 7b9fada2
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-24 03:55:00 -0600
subject: fix(tests): flush-race mutex + image-fetch-hardening mock + antigravity 429→6

- src/lib/db/repos/requestDetailsRepo.js: async-mutex pattern for
  flushToDatabase — waiters loop-await flushInFlight so they observe
  the committed drain, eliminating the stranded-items race where a
  caller resolved while the producer's fire-and-forget flush was
  still mid-commit
- tests/unit/image-fetch-hardening.test.js: lookupMock now returns
  [{address, family}] arrays to match node:dns/promises lookup({all:true})
  contract (same root cause as codex-image-fetch)
- open-sse/providers/registry/antigravity.js: raise 429 retry attempts
  from 3 to 6 (branch-introduced test contract in executor-const-guard
  said 'intentional change: 429=6' but registry was never updated)

MiMo A APPROVE (flush-race async mutex)
MiMo B APPROVE (image-fetch-hardening mock arrays)
MiMo D APPROVE (antigravity 429→6)


